FAAC 3.0 removes the legacy `faacEnc*` API. Raptor still drove it for
the RTMP audio encoder and the RSP transcoder on this branch.

Move both users to `faac_params` / `faac_encoder_*`: open once with the
LC mono raw configuration, size the PCM from `frame_samples` and the
output from `max_output_bytes`, and check the status instead of a
negative byte count. These streams are mono, so bit_rate is already
whole-stream.

